The English and German word lists are adapted from:
  List of Dirty, Naughty, Obscene, and Otherwise Bad Words
  LDNOOBW / Shutterstock and contributors
  https://github.com/LDNOOBW/List-of-Dirty-Naughty-Obscene-and-Otherwise-Bad-Words
  Upstream revision: 5faf2ba42d7b1c0977169ec3611df25a3c08eb13

