Changes in this project:
  Selected a subset of the English and German lists for player names;
  omitted neutral, medical, and identity terms;
  added the compound "cocksucker" and the German stem "scheiß";
  classified ambiguous terms for whole-token matching;
  added local false-positive exceptions in allow.txt.

The license applies to the adapted word-list data. It does not change the
license of the application's Go code.

extremism.txt contains locally authored display-name policy rules, separate
from the adapted upstream profanity lists. Their reference sources and numeric
matching policy are documented in internal/namefilter/README.md in the source
repository.
